      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "Once upon a time, before the dawn of the Outcasts, all the Glitch lived peacefully together. They had their villages and castles and fields and all sorts of other things that robots like. They lived happily and prosperously, thousands of minds working together. But one day, a single Glitch walked into the castle, took a seat on the throne, and loudly proclaimed; 'Decisive. I am the king.'"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "昔々、アウトキャストの夜明け前、グリッチ族は皆平和的に暮らしていた。 村や城、畑など、ロボットが好きなものがたくさんありました。 彼らは幸せに豊かに暮らし、何千人もの心が一緒に働きました。 ある日、一人のグリッチが城に入り、王座に座り、大声で「決定的」と宣言した。 私は王です。'"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "The other Glitch stared at this unusual sight for a while, but did not know what to say. A self-proclaimed ruler was not something they were prepared for. As such, and with no real understanding of the situation , the Glitch were forced to obey."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "もう一人のグリッチはしばらくの間、この珍しい光景をじっと見詰めていたが、何を言うべきか分からなかった。 自己宣言的な支配者は、彼らが準備していたものではありませんでした。 そのため、状況の本当の理解がないまま、グリッチは従わざるを得なかった。"
    }
